  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing a Green Logistics Module for Vocational Training in support of green transition in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to support Vietnamese Vocational Education and Training (VET) institutions in equipping students with the necessary skills for green logistics. Ultimately, the project aims to enhance the quality of VET graduates to meet the green transition demands of the logistics industry, thereby contributing to Vietnam&apos;s sustainable development.</narrative>
